---
/**
 * Records where this browser first arrived from, once, on its first page view.
 *
 * Its own component rather than a line in Layout.astro so the reason survives:
 * the owner asked on 2026-08-28 which customers came from Instagram, and the
 * honest answer was 4 of 74 — because nothing recorded it, not because the
 * rest came from elsewhere. See lib/source.ts for why first touch wins.
 *
 * Nothing renders. No cookie, no third party, no network call — it reads the
 * referrer the browser already sent and keeps one string in this browser's own
 * storage until the customer places an order.
 */
---

<script>
  import { rememberSource } from '../lib/source';
  rememberSource();
</script>
